        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-addition-basic-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Join people and add another case",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "和 joins people or things inside one phrase. 也 goes before the predicate to add another person or case; it does not join two full sentences like English and.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "老师和学生学中文。",
                "pinyin": "lǎoshī hé xuéshēng xué Zhōngwén 。",
                "meaning": "The teacher and students study Chinese.",
                "audio": "d6288abc1731c1ab42fc3238b80ae8cd2bb571a449a51c66348587cbe9a4dded"
              },
              {
                "text": "老师也学中文。",
                "pinyin": "lǎoshī yě xué Zhōngwén 。",
                "meaning": "The teacher studies Chinese too.",
